e 5: recommendation-contract-and-brief\\\"\\n3: description: \\\"Ordered worker-sized tasks that generate one command table, fill four recommendation fields, print the command and its policy in the brief, state the degraded contract, fix the reach check and retire the legacy ids.\\\"\\n4: trigger_phrases:\\n5:   - \\\"recommendation contract and brief tasks\\\"\\n6: importance_tier: \\\"normal\\\"\\n7: contextType: \\\"general\\\"\\n8: ---\\n9: <!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: tasks-core | v2.4 -->\\n10: # Tasks: Phase 5: recommendation-contract-and-brief\\n11: \\n12: <!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\\n13: \\n14: ---\\n15: \\n16: <!-- ANCHOR:notation -->\\n17: ## Task Notation\\n18: \\n19: | Prefix | Meaning |\\n20: |--------|---------|\\n21: | `[ ]` | Pending |\\n22: | `[x]` | Completed |\\n23: | `[P]` | Parallelizable |\\n24: | `[B]` | Blocked |\\n25: \\n26: **Task Format**: `T### [P?] Description (file path). Verify: <command> prints <expected output>`\\n27: \\n28: Every command runs from the repository root unless a task says otherwise.\\n29: - `ADV` is `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime`. `HK` is `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks`.\\n30: - `D` is `$ADV/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs`. `G` is ...\n  Line 46: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794528206170,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d2375985001Hyf7GLc1UQl1NY\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dcb0a25ffeKDrFVYdzDGhvxv\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d237444a001JheBImZQNHAYPy\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_9a760a39275e4d31bc48d151\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"command-spec-kit-(plan|complete|implement|resume)\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/plan.md | head -30\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"},\"output\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md:61:A model that reads the hook brief sees `use command-speckit-save` or `use command-spec-kit-plan`, a raw scorer id that names no slash command and no policy. The public recommendation carries a `command` field only when a hub attaches one, and it never carries a policy, a kind or an owner, so a caller cannot tell whether to run, start or ask. When the daemon is down, the local Python scorer returns command rows such as `command-create-readme` for a plain prompt, and nothing says what a degraded brief may show.\\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md:78:{\\\"skillId\\\":\\\"command-spec-kit-plan\\\",\\\"score\\\":0.563727,\\\"confidence\\\":0.823,\\\"uncertainty\\\":0.16,\\\"dominantLane\\\":\\\"explicit_author\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\"}\\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md:84:Advisor: live; use command-spec-kit-plan 0.82/0.16 pass.\\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/spec.md:111:[\\\"command-s...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/logs/w8-T038.out:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794529051563,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dbc3ae5ffes1Ef3Xp19Y6IEG\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d2444376002yb0pg6ve1HyljQ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dbc3ae5ffes1Ef3Xp19Y6IEG\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d244378a0010Vj0dtfR2HCHr1\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_ae29936a8d694be9b8c1fb77\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkm