\",\"text\":\"f8a7f6fc10 test(system-skill-advisor): record the before arm on six runtimes\\n49281dd652 feat(system-skill-advisor): add the embedder cost measurement script\\nd8797702e8 feat(system-skill-advisor): guard doctor lead phrases and document the harness\\n2920b1abef docs(system-skill-advisor): record the smoke run of the behaviour harness\\nf633021670 docs(system-skill-advisor): add the autonomous goal for command surfacing\\n1c80022452 fix(system-skill-advisor): stop calling a confidence floor or a held skill a ...\n  Line 39: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794530197185,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dad3a2dffe46l7KA6EEh2b1G\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d255bbff001C7mVSqFq8JeAiu\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dad3a2dffe46l7KA6EEh2b1G\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d25548ee001WayeoPuSFDxbVn\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_6a95427066884726bd77b872\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"git -c core.fsmonitor=false show 1c80022452 -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/ambiguity.ts .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/scorer/advisor-quality-049-003.vitest.ts\"},\"output\":\"commit 1c80022452b8748399e3c581e83217532f7bfcee\\nAuthor: Michel Kerkmeester <82775228+MichelKerkmeester@users.noreply.github.com>\\nDate:   Tue Oct 27 11:10:13 2026 +0100\\n\\n    fix(system-skill-advisor): stop calling a confidence floor or a held skill a tie\\n    \\n    The advisor flagged 110 of 261 labelled routing prompts as ambiguous,\\n    mostly because the task-intent confidence floor lifts unrelated skills\\n    to 0.82, within the 0.05 confidence margin of a top that earned its\\n    confidence. A floored skill now clusters on the score margin alone when\\n    the top is not floored, and a skill the typed-command bound held below\\n    a command's owner records that owner as heldBelow and never clusters\\n    with it. The brief uses the scorer's ambiguity answer and names a real\\n    cluster member after \\\"vs\\\", and the low-information abstention still\\n    reads the wider cluster so a floored skill cannot top an\\n    under-specified prompt.\\n    \\n    Over the 261 prompts, flags fall from 110 to 78 with the same 202\\n    correct top skills and no top skill changed; the typed\\n    /deep:research :auto prompt now reads ambiguous false. Released as\\n    system-skill-advisor 0.17.7.0. Also keeps /specs/other/ local.\\n    \\n    Spec: system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/024-typed-command-ambiguity\\n    Commit-Id: 0012433\\n\\ndiff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/ambiguity.ts b...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/logs/w0b-T055.out:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794522385627,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d1de89e3001h9tZ1f5BCFisKN\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e22251effedzgdgxW9ZYGzGw\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d1de7a14001CZQJida1h3QDLX\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_d1623fdb5036415ba4f15d60\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/tasks.md, lines 1-284\\n1: ---\\n2: title: \\\"Tasks: Phase 5: recommendation-contract-and-brief\\\"\\n3: description: \\\"Ordered worker-sized tasks that generate one command table, fill four recommendation fields, print the command and its policy in the brief, state the degraded contract, fix the reach check and retire the legacy ids.\\\"\\n4: 