{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794530346294,"sessionID":"ses_e2dad3a2dffe46l7KA6EEh2b1G","part":{"partID":"prt_1d257fc3d001Z6J4sbcWcAwVEP","sessionID":"ses_e2dad3a2dffe46l7KA6EEh2b1G","messageID":"msg_1d257f634001OaFcynGwt4g9Ib","type":"tool","id":"call_902ad1d8288e4852910720cc","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/ambiguity.ts","oldString":"  const scoreGap = Math.abs(top.score - recommendation.score);\n  if (scoreGap <= AMBIGUITY_MARGIN + Number.EPSILON) return true;\n  // A floor pins many unrelated skills to the same confidence, which is not a\n  // tie with a top that earned its confidence from its own evidence.\n  const floorOnlyMember = applyFloorException\n    && recommendation.confidenceFloored === true\n    && top.confidenceFloored !== true;\n  if (floorOnlyMember) return false;\n  return Math.abs(top.confidence - recommendation.confidence)\n    <= AMBIGUITY_CONFIDENCE_MARGIN + Number.EPSILON;","newString":"  const scoreGap = Math.abs(top.score - recommendation.score);\n  if (scoreGap <= AMBIGUITY_MARGIN + Number.EPSILON) return true;\n  // The score margin already failed, so a floored member has nothing left to\n  // cluster on. Its confidence is the floor, not its own evidence.\n  const flooredMember = applyFloorException && recommendation.confidenceFloored === true;\n  if (flooredMember) return false;\n  return Math.abs(top.confidence - recommendation.confidence)\n    <= AMBIGUITY_CONFIDENCE_MARGIN + Number.EPSILON;"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/ambiguity.ts (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/ambiguity.ts","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/ambiguity.ts\n===================================================================\n--- .s